      "description": "The catalogue itself: `catalogue.json` declares the corpus and its measured size; `nodes/` holds one `folio-catalogue-node/v1` per community, collection or item; `records/` holds the `folio-dublin-core/v1` metadata an item node points at through `metadataRef`. TWELVE nodes today — 9 referenced, 3 materialized, 0 unknown — against 1,057,223 files upstream, and that gap IS the point. `bun run cat check:catalogue` verifies every node validates and every metadataRef, libraryId and parent path resolves; a Zod schema can require the reference and structurally cannot check the file is there.",
